cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use CHIMERA, cite this exact software version and repository URL,
  and cite each generated benchmark dataset with its own persistent identifier.
type: software
title: "CHIMERA: leakage-aware virus-versus-host benchmark generator"
abstract: >-
  CHIMERA generates deterministic synthetic DNA-fragment evaluation bundles
  for virus-versus-host classifiers, including random-fragment, genome-level,
  similarity-filtered, temporal, and taxonomic holdout protocols with auditable
  truth, assignments, exclusions, provenance, and checksums.
authors:
  - name: CHIMERA contributors
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-08
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alexander-Mitrofanov/CHIMERA"
url: "https://github.com/Alexander-Mitrofanov/CHIMERA"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - benchmark
  - metagenomics
  - machine learning
  - virus
  - data leakage
  - reproducibility
